download these locally on your pc before running -- 

  1. pip install opencv-python deepface (installs opencv and deepface)
  2. pip install tensorflow (ML framework)
  3. pip install tensorflow[and-cuda] (for better fps and only if you have gpu)
  4. pip install mtcnn retina-face mediapipe (optional )
  5. pip install flask gunicorn numpy
     (required for running the web interface; flask = UI server, gunicorn = production server, numpy = core math lib)

